  },
  "body": "That is, document.open/close/write/writeln now all throw immediately if\nused while the parser is invoking a custom element constructor, to\nprevent them from messing with the token stream. Closes #1630 and closes\nhttps://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/537.\n\n---\n\nWhile here I moved some steps around inside document.write a bit to put all the \"if X, do nothing or throw\" steps before everything else. It's just editorial.\n",
